    "type": "p",
    "content": "1. Eager initialization (În momentul declarării câmpului)"
  },
  {
    "type": "code",
    "code": "class Car {\n   private Engine engine = new Engine();\n \n   ...\n}"
  },
  {
    "type": "p",
    "content": "1. Lazy initialization (Doar cand este necesar)"
  },
  {
    "type": "code",
    "code": "class Car {\n   private Engine engine;\n \n   public Engine initializeEngine() {\n      if (engine == null) {\n         engine = new Engine();\n      }\n \n      return engine;\n   }\n}"
  },
